 "words": 366,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Bless the LORD, my soul;",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "all that is within me, bless his holy name.",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 1.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Bless the LORD, my soul, and do not forget all his benefits\u2014",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "he forgives all your sin and heals all your diseases;",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "he redeems your life from the pit and crowns you with steadfast love and mercy;",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "he satisfies you with good as long as you live, so your youth is renewed like the eagle's.",
   "heard": 18,
   "words": 18,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD does what is right and brings justice to all who are oppressed.",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 1.6,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He made known his ways to Moses, his deeds to the people of Israel.",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 3.13,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD is merciful and gracious, slow to anger and abounding in steadfast love.",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 14,
   "error_s": 3.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He will not always accuse, nor hold his anger forever.",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 4.53,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He does not treat us as our sins deserve or repay us according to our guilt.",
   "heard": 16,
   "words": 16,
   "error_s": 8.61,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For as high as the heavens are above the earth, so great is his steadfast love toward those who fear him.",
   "heard": 21,
   "words": 21,
   "error_s": 12.36,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "As far as the east is from the west, so far has he removed our transgressions from us.",
   "heard": 18,
   "words": 18,
   "error_s": 10.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "As a father has compassion on his children, so the LORD has compassion on those who fear him.",
   "heard": 18,
   "words": 18,
   "error_s": 12.29,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "For he knows how we are formed;",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 12.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "he remembers that we are dust.",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 14.9,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "As for man, his days are like grass;",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 16.74,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "he blooms like a flower of the field\u2014",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 16.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "for the wind passes over it, and it is gone, and its place knows it no more.",
   "heard": 17,
   "words": 17,
   "error_s": 11.85,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "But the steadfast love of the LORD rests from everlasting to everlasting on those who fear him, and his righteousness on their children's children\u2014",
   "heard": 24,
   "words": 24,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "to those who keep his covenant and remember to obey his precepts.",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD has established his throne in the heavens, and his kingdom rules over all.",
   "heard": 15,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bless the LORD, you his angels, you mighty ones who do his word, obeying the voice of his word.",
   "heard": 19,
   "words": 19,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bless the LORD, all his hosts, you his servants who do his will.",
   "heard": 13,
   "words": 13,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bless the LORD, all his works, in every place of his dominion.",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bless the LORD, my soul.",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.27,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bless the LORD, my soul;",
